'''Garden Chips''' are items unlocked from various areas regarding [[The Garden]] and {{Skill|Farming}} that provide permanent buffs. They can be upgraded with {{Sowdust}}, which increases their bonuses up to {{Green|Level 20}}. '''Garden Chips''' can increase their rarity by consuming extras of the same type.

The '''Garden Chips''' interface can be accessed by talking to {{NPCSprite|Jeff}}, in the [[SkyBlock Menu]] while in {{Zone|The Garden}}, in the {{Skill|Farming}} Skill menu, or via the {{Code|/chips}} command.

